{"articleNo":"121157","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=121157&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2015학년도 1학기 복학생 학과 변경 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.01.20","hit":"6033","attachments":[{"name":"복학생 학과 변경내역.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=121157&attachNo=4213"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#290066\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">모집단위 폐지 및 신설에 따른 </span></font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#290066\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2015학년도 1학기 복학생의 학과 변경 일정</span></font></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\">을 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">아래와<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> </span></span><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">같이</span><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" size=\"3\"> </font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">알려드립니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#4c4c4c\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\">&lt;&lt;복학대상 통보문(우편물)에 학과 변경 내용 포함&gt;&gt;</span></span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#290066\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 복학 신청 내역 및 방법 : 첨부물 참조</span></span></span></font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><!--StartFragment--><font size=\"+0\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #f6f6f6\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; 가. 학부(과)가 1:1로 변경되는 경우 : 원스톱으로 복학 신청</span><br></font></font></span><font size=\"+0\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #f6f6f6\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1)&nbsp;복학 확정 후 교무처에서 일괄 학과 변경</span></font></font></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #f6f6f6\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) </span>예외 학과 // 물리학전공</font></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#747474\"><font size=\"+0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #f6f6f6\" size=\"+0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;: 학사서비스센터 방문 복학 신청, 학과 방문 병행(필히 상담 받으세요)</font></span></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#747474\">&nbsp; </font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #f6f6f6\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; 나. 학부(과)/전공을 선택해야 하는 경우 : 학사서비스센터 방문 복학 신청</span></font></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #f6f6f6\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">복학신청 시 복학원에 복학학과 기재→ 복학 확정 후 교무처에서 학과 변경 처리</span></font></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #f6f6f6\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #f6f6f6\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) </span></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">예외 학과 // 기계계열, 기계공학부 1학년 2학기~4학년</span></font></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #f6f6f6\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 원스톱서비스로 복학 신청, 학과행정실로 학과 배정 신청</span></font></span></font></p><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #f6f6f6\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #f6f6f6\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) </span></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">예외 학과 // 고분자공학전공, 정보나노소재공학전공 3~4학년, </span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #f6f6f6\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 산업시스템공학전공 4학년</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #f6f6f6\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; : 원스톱서비스로 복학 신청, 학부행정실로 전공 배정 신청</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 다. 화학소재융합학부로 학과변경&nbsp;된 경우에는 학과변경 전 학과(전공)에 따라 전공이 배정됩니다. 타&nbsp;전공을 선택할 수 없습니다.</span></p></span></font><p class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 예시) 응용화학과 학생이 화학소재융합학부로 학과변경된 경우, 1학년 말 전공 배정 시 응용화학전공으로 배정됨</span></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"></strong></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">2. </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">복학기간 : 2015.02.02.(월)~02.09.(월)</span></strong></span><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">3. 수강신청 기간</span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; 가. 1학년, 4학년 이상 : 2015.02.10.(화)~02.11.(수)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; 나. 2학년, 3학년 : 2015.02.12.(목)~02.13.(금)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">2015. 1. 20.</span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">